,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"a78d4d154de48bff86cbaef2e6114cabd2f32ba9","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGE3OGQ0ZDE1NGRlNDhiZmY4NmNiYWVmMmU2MTE0Y2FiZDJmMzJiYTk","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/a78d4d154de48bff86cbaef2e6114cabd2f32ba9","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/a78d4d154de48bff86cbaef2e6114cabd2f32ba9","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-03T14:29:39Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-11-10T19:38:33Z"},"tree":{"sha":"5d82d75997330d3145b89f712cce363104047a6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/5d82d75997330d3145b89f712cce363104047a6d"},"message":"hscontrol/state: allow expired auth keys for node re-registration\n\nSkip auth key validation for existing nodes re-registering with the same\nNodeKey. Pre-auth keys are only required for initial authentication.\n\nNodeKey rotation still requires a valid auth key as it is a security-sensitive\noperation that changes the node's cryptographic identity.\n\nFixes #2830","parents":[{"sha":"5a2ee0c391eef946a2fa8afa9d09a913ea490cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/5a2ee0c391eef946a2fa8afa9d09a913ea490cf5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/5a2ee0c391eef946a2fa8afa9d09a913ea490cf5"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQD/mgNiBYC9KcuTo85IvpXq98dahtjU2T2peodcLcarGYCMDWz2XuvBwfEj/uFvWcp\nz1Hqi2UTfloimlAWXZkgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 5d82d75997330d3145b89f712cce363104047a6d\nparent 5a2ee0c391eef946a2fa8afa9d09a913ea490cf5\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762180179 +0100\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1762803513 